e88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-05-16T01:50:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T21:03:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - macOS Sequoia (15.7.4) - Single-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M1 Pro - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen trying to draw 1px lines in Godot 4.6.2, the drawing behavior is inconsistent accross various settings. But most importantly, a 1 px line without anti-aliasing **doesn't draw at all at 45 degrees**.\n\nFor those who are into pixelart products, this is a major bug which should be fixed ASAP.\n\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/308f3282-5190-4d68-b81f-427d93929486\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDown below, I included a Scene with an embedded script which you just have to run to evaluate the problem on your machine. Just create a new project, import it and run it.\n\n**EDIT: In the Project Settings, enable \"snap_2d_vertices_to_pixel\".**\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[streak_lines.tscn.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27839068/streak_lines.tscn.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119504/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119504/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}